  "historyNote": "#1689, eff 12-22-80; ss by#2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88, EXPIRED: 1-20-94 New. #10988, eff 12-7-15; ss by #14646, eff 9-4-26, EXPIRES: 9-4-36 (formerly Frl 602.03)",
